ef="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/fImykYX-SyN46gsrJpaKNBrOOLBb_EceqMxUFUr9YmjH_kBrebjt9BN_1AgEE9wR64O8QMFtC5aUsg4U38aJdpx15awhHt2xcpdr-1Z0qPQYqH8G7g_wuC3D4WU6aYhE9aPOllkxQODLy8jvHe3yFypC6nfBEyRTXbJNyeYVBTiu9SARUqc40exHZgYPfmrsH5NzJd_pSeNOP7ZqFd-eAOt81Nr4_xphFvWN2Xsk0qWcSLdA-A7EYI4AYgtYyrBsKwcnmPgdxvft9Iy1YCXejIjEIIS0_RFKtsyfycHcNOx5M_zymDlppBY8djLbY2hFClK8YmeYTIYf3LHpbvrQN9s5xvkoW_UGC4TpdxRNtlx3PzkQokiaWrUz3vXbpQRFx3D1At79zVuE7FMudEN4LCWQf1fRtgv-WwyUFORbJ2uha0h0pLBcpN0uQmVdRKY1OPZhAgGdwwmAPcBfpznkDKX6AdAjZ5RobWN5lEUy8MkO9NubxcI-cxtriy13S69AaYr-CgBMM3zNbfjT39se-t1kiao/ugYwZn_3TE1gHob5DBsvpgMcL5IHv3Th/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="沙特下个月不向欧洲石油买家提供供应"&gt;正因伊朗战争而遭受更多的附带损害&lt;/a&gt;。沙特阿美公司告诉非洲大陆至少两家炼油客户， &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/R1oR0KpAH1nxygNH0WUsUY3fBdRSjkPLjPWEWJ87LFJ-BA_QGtWO86HcUK_XLF-mNjnOWvnP44GJrGJzkngE9zefcldfuIrrEHvWtNEhUwX3-zCnG2XtawrU8dPcK7D5CYRlPexcva2HBzHb6jB-4Z_hrBB6nWSCJQCdHvsAfkfl0LAK8bLTDlRDoiEOkOPzPTrjSWvE03BBZpkLxcw_HbqvKUi4KYH2Qu4ggAB-yYVCWPb3L_yr9wPvsv9nSnRe8Tn5VwpOF5yjhsPDoAjsqkIgOjhaapqby16cI9lymSjYuR6bnyhqwo0NoYHFTIG7b8Eult6PaoSSmLoaFuWFYzyF3-NngJiCuEq0rCxkgHHJyPbP-LP7HW7DU9kAYlv2XxKItXTM_Lp7_4S9Iq3JAlFKjhWEbaayFaO1auW_pYIa6MfEe1qxT56EaSfHkKISDNJjb0Jbjdfc408jiPDjMYovpUeAiOYhugXTRPp9fetJBMwA7bl_Fa5HNd8aQbm2iXHdz3frlwMBXY4FmI5-UlTT9DXFlSogaO3kag/5Pwe6xdodOtX3TDTqzS73CzgDSs63JVr/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="为什么沙特的一条管道对全球石油市场至关重要"&gt;在通往红海的一条重要管道遭到袭击后，&lt;/a&gt;根据长期协议，他们下个月将不会获得任何原油。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;下个月沙特资金的缺失将增加欧洲买家寻找替代品的需求。波兰的 Orlen SA 已经在寻找出货量，帮助推高该地区石油等级的价格。即期布伦特原油是欧洲现实世界石油的基准，本周一度突破 130 美元。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;据报道，沙特阿拉伯在遭到从伊拉克发射的无人机袭击后被迫关闭了东西向管道。最近几周，中东地区的战斗陷入僵局，包括也门胡塞武装在内的与伊朗结盟的武装力量&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/CD_0LEoyAMJMFK7USlfGb5bz_iI47Uhp8wJ_VmHOc55I8MSG7jufH-LlN1vn98